dfasx3yi0o/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3346/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3346" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3346"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasgroh9a/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3347/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3347" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3347"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas1rowft/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3348/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3348" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3348"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas9mtglb/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3349/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3349" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3349"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas3vxtds/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3350/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3350" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3350"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfashne953/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width:1.4%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3351/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3351" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3351"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasy019mg/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" rowspan="3" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3352/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3352" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3352"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas4kqf9f/"></a>3-босқич</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3353/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3353" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3353"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfaskofkra/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="3" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3354/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3354" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3354"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas4h3nxe/"></a>Давлат солиқ бошқармаси, ЙСТБҲДСИ</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3355/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3355" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3355"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasgx0qbr/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdRight bdLeft" rowspan="2" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3356/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3356" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3356"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasvg7g4g/"></a>1. Ариза ва унга илова қилинган ҳужжатларни (ахборотни) кўриб чиқади ҳамда солиқ мониторингини ўтказиш ёки уни ўтказишни рад этиш тўғрисида қарор қабул қилади.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3357/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3357" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3357"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasuzqwqv/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdRight bdLeft" rowspan="2" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3358/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3358" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3358"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas5u5uzg/"></a>1. Ариза берилган йилнинг 1 ноябрига қадар</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width:1.4%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3359/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3359" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3359"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasgiety1/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdTop bdRight bdLeft" rowspan="2" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3360/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3360" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3360"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasc5oguw/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdRight bdLeft" rowspan="2" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3361/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3361" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3361"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasgs335d/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdRight bdLeft" rowspan="2" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3362/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3362" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3362"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasdzdpk9/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdLeft" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; width:1.4%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3363/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3363" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3363"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfason4zqr/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3364/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3364" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3364"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfask7oeyf/"></a>2. Қабул қилинган қарорни ариза берувчига ёзма равишда ёки солиқ тўловчининг шахсий кабинети орқали электрон шаклда юборади.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3365/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3365" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3365"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasmkctvo/"></a>2. Қарор қабул қилинган кундан бошлаб 5 кун мобайнида</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width:1.4%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3366/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3366" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3366"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasl7b3yx/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3367/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3367" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3367"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas1ypm8b/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3368/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3368" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3368"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasek8w1w/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3369/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3369" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3369"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas01ccwo/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3370/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3370" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3370"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas1kz6il/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3371/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3371" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3371"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasfibrwq/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3372/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3372" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3372"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas2r7mhm/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3373/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3373" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3373"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasqbsbwo/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width:1.4%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3374/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3374" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3374"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasgvu7g1/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" rowspan="2" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3375/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3375" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3375"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas3smyhq/"></a>4-босқич</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3376/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3376" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3376"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasqw1e7o/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="2" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3377/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3377" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3377"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas6okdg3/"></a>Давлат солиқ бошқармаси, ЙСТБҲДСИ</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3378/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3378" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3378"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfaspx2gxy/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="2" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3379/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3379" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3379"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfashzc4q4/"></a>Солиқ мониторингини ўтказиш жараёнида:</p><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3380/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3380" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3380"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasnnnyva/"></a>реал вақт режимида солиқ тўловчининг операциялари ва ҳужжатларини масофадан туриб кузатиб боради;</p><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3381/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3381" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3381"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfashmecbp/"></a>солиқлар ва йиғимлар бўйича ҳисоб-китобларнинг синтетик ва аналитик ҳисобини юритиш тартибини таҳлил қилади;</p><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3382/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3382" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3382"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasyai0nc/"></a>ҳар бир операциянинг ҳужжатли тасдиғини текширади;</p><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3383/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3383" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3383"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasgv7dzg/"></a>солиқ базаси солиқ тўғрисидаги қонунчилик ҳужжатлари нормаларига мувофиқ тўғри шакллантирилишини назорат қилади;</p><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3384/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3384" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3384"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfashrpcin/"></a>солиқ мажбуриятларининг бухгалтерия ҳисоби ва солиқ ҳисоботида ўз вақтида, тўлиқ ва тўғри акс эттирилганлигини, шунингдек, уларнинг бажарилишини назорат қилади;</p><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3385/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3385" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3385"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasqoex1y/"></a>солиқ имтиёзларидан фойдаланишнинг асосланганлигини назорат қилади.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3386/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3386" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3386"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasc1reck/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="2" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3387/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3387" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3387"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas8xbss2/"></a>Солиқ мониторингини ўтказиш даврида (солиқ мониторинги ўтказиладиган йилнинг 1 январидан кейинги йилнинг 1 июлига қадар)</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width:1.4%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3388/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3388" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3388"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfaso22e0e/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdTop bdRight bdLeft" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3389/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3389" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3389"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfash45a7f/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdRight bdLeft" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3390/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3390" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3390"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfassb51rs/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdRight bdLeft" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3391/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3391" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3391"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasu5qxtm/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdLeft" style="width:1.4%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3392/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3392" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3392"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfastg5a3d/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3393/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3393" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3393"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasvav67h/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3394/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3394" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3394"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas50ngfo/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3395/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3395" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3395"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas0r230y/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3396/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3396" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3396"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas9mg4b6/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3397/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3397" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3397"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasniml8c/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3398/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3398" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3398"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas4l2mcr/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3399/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3399" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3399"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfaslme6eg/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width:1.4%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3400/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3400" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3400"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasl6wpb1/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3401/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3401" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3401"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasp284a9/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3402/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3402" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3402"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasxhq9n6/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3403/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3403" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3403"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasgvqezw/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3404/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3404" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3404"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfascl8w4g/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3405/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3405" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3405"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasbfdsgn/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3406/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3406" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3406"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas5i4wf7/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3407/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3407" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3407"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasng8dn1/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width:1.4%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3408/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3408" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3408"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasd3umhg/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" rowspan="2" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3409/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3409" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3409"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasbzqzpy/"></a>5-босқич</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3410/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3410" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3410"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas2a9lec/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="2" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3411/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3411" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3411"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasz4wgyq/"></a>Давлат солиқ бошқармаси, ЙСТБҲДСИ</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3412/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3412" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3412"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasecym36/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="2" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3413/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3413" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3413"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasx520im/"></a>Солиқ мониторингини ўтказиш даврида ёки мониторинг натижаси бўйича тақдим этилган ҳужжатлардаги маълумотлар ўртасида тафовутлар ёхуд солиқ тўловчи томонидан тақдим этилган ва солиқ органида мавжуд бўлган маълумотлар ўртасида номувофиқликлар аниқланган тақдирда, солиқ тўловчига ушбу ҳолатларга тушунтиришлар бериш ёки тегишли тузатишлар киритиш талаби билан ёзма шаклда ёки солиқ тўловчининг шахсий кабинети орқали электрон шаклда талабнома юборади.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3414/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3414" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3414"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas5404c1/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="2" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3415/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3415" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3415"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas5sketh/"></a>Заруратга кўра</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width:1.4%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3416/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3416" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3416"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasvrvdsb/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdTop bdRight bdLeft" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3417/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3417" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3417"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas7dglvz/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdRight bdLeft" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3418/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3418" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3418"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/1061