ument/90/10613/dfas3fd4fu/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="3" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3431/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3431" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3431"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasdop38l/"></a>Солиқ тўловчи</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3432/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3432" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3432"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasbds0dm/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdRight bdLeft" rowspan="2" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3433/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3433" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3433"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasdlynsp/"></a>Солиқ органининг талабномасига биноан:</p><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3434/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3434" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3434"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas52popd/"></a>1. Ёзма ёки шахсий кабинети орқали электрон шаклда тушунтиришлар тақдим этади.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3435/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3435" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3435"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas8uo3ub/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdRight bdLeft" rowspan="2" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3436/" data-role="