data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3453"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasa3r5fa/"></a>7-босқич</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3454/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3454" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3454"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasb3trve/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdRight bdLeft" rowspan="2" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3455/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3455" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3455"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas7wwe55/"></a>1. Солиқ тўловчи</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3456/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3456" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3456"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasc6lx2b/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdRight bdLeft" rowspan="2" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3457/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3457" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3457"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas01nntp/"></a>Давлат солиқ бошқармаси ёки ЙСТБҲДСИга солиқ мониторинги даврида ёки мониторинг натижаси бўйича солиқ ва йиғимларнинг тўғри ҳисоблаб чиқилганлигига оид масалалар юзасидан асослантирилган фикрини олиш учун сўровнома юборади.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3458/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3458" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3458"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasb5i4u0/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdRight bdLeft" rowspan="2" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3459/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3459" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3459"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas55znfi/"></a>1. Заруратга кўра</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width:1.4%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3460/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3460" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3460"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasog7bqa/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdTop bdRight bdLeft" rowspan="2" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3461/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3461" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3461"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasy1rg62/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdRight bdLeft" rowspan="2" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3462/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3462" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3462"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas283i60/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdRight bdLeft" rowspan="2" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3463/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3463" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3463"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasyz2iyg/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdLeft" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; width:1.4%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3464/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3464" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3464"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfashtn5ge/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3465/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3465" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3465"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfaszwtsf0/"></a>2. Давлат солиқ бошқармаси, ЙСТБҲДСИ</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3466/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3466" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3466"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasx1eque/"></a>Солиқ тўловчининг сўровига биноан солиқ органининг асослантирилган фикрини тузади ва ёзма равишда ёки солиқ тўловчининг шахсий кабинети орқали электрон шаклда юборади.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3467/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3467" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3467"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasa198kr/"></a>2. Сўров олинган кундан бошлаб ўн беш кун мобайнида. (қўшимча ҳужжатлар талаб қилинса бир ой муддатда)</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width:1.4%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3468/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3468" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3468"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas1cnm3i/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3469/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3469" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3469"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas7gmbsz/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3470/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3470" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3470"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfaskowb6y/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3471/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3471" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3471"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasgc4r3v/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3472/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3472" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3472"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas33g40w/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3473/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3473" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3473"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasbucdke/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3474/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3474" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3474"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasinarkz/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3475/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3475" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3475"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasvbbo4v/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width:1.4%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3476/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3476" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3476"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfastotf5l/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" rowspan="2" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3477/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3477" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3477"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas92k27q/"></a>8-босқич</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3478/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3478" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3478"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasswf7bn/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="2" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3479/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3479" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3479"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasot9yk4/"></a>Солиқ тўловчи</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3480/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3480" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3480"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas1vp88s/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="2" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3481/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3481" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3481"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas1udggv/"></a>1. Давлат солиқ бошқармаси, ЙСТБҲДСИнинг асослантирилган фикрига розилиги тўғрисида ҳамда ушбу асослантирилган фикр бажарилганлигини тасдиқловчи ҳужжатларни илова қилган ҳолда ёзма ёки солиқ тўловчининг шахсий кабинети орқали электрон шаклда хабардор қилади.</p><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3482/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3482" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3482"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasrlsoox/"></a>2. Солиқ органининг асослантирилган фикрига рози бўлмаган тақдирда, солиқ органига ўз эътирозларини ёзма ёки солиқ тўловчининг шахсий кабинети орқали электрон шаклда тақдим этади.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3483/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3483" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3483"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasucb343/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="2" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3484/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3484" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3484"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasgdvnkp/"></a>Асослантирилган фикр олинган кундан бошлаб бир ой мобайнида</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width:1.4%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3485/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3485" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3485"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas169kzn/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdTop bdRight bdLeft" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3486/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3486" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3486"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas7bsfgn/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdRight bdLeft" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3487/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3487" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3487"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasaka57l/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdRight bdLeft" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3488/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3488" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3488"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfascse66k/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdLeft" style="width:1.4%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3489/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3489" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3489"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas8f3guh/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3490/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3490" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3490"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas5ycg29/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3491/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3491" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3491"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas4mkzdd/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3492/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3492" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3492"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasnus1dz/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3493/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3493" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3493"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasgogdz4/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3494/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3494" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3494"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas0fpss9/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3495/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3495" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3495"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas6n23z8/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3496/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3496" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3496"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas6sz121/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width:1.4%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3497/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3497" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3497"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasffy6wm/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" rowspan="2" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3498/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3498" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3498"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasgu8tam/"></a>9-босқич</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3499/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3499" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3499"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfaszgngxn/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="2" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3500/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3500" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3500"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasfpdfg7/"></a>Давлат солиқ бошқармаси, ЙСТБҲДСИ</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3501/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3501" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3501"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasoc3lp8/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="2" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3502/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3502" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3502"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasdlz70s/"></a>Солиқ тўловчининг эътирозларини ўзида мавжуд бўлган барча материаллар билан бирга Ўзбекистон Республикаси Давлат солиқ қўмитасига ўзаро келишув тартиб-таомили ташаббуси билан чиқиш учун юборади.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3503/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3503" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3503"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas25ran1/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="2" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3504/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3504" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3504"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasz3qa0r/"></a>Эътирозлар олинган кундан бошлаб уч кун мобайнида</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width:1.4%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3505/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3505" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3505"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas97mipb/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdTop bdRight bdLeft" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3506/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3506" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3506"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasgp6yzt/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdRight bdLeft" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/bssPhr3507/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3507" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3507"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfase24up4/"></a>&#160;</td><td cla