="20" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas4rdeuv/"></a>савдо шохобчасида фойдаланиш учун, ____________________________________________________ русумли,<br>завод рақами (версияси)________________________________________________бўлган онлайн-НКМ (виртуал<br>касса) ва __________________________________________________________серия рақамли фискал модулни,<br>_____________________________________________________давлат солиқ инспекциясида рўйхатга қўйишда<br>амалий ёрдам беришингизни сўрайман.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfastfc7hg/"></a>&#160;</td><td colspan="10" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas6fsn9n/"></a>Қуйидаги ҳужжатлар илова қилинади:</p></td><td style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfaso6z64y/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfastahqx1/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasz70vru/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfash12iyl/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfaspgmeuw/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasqs2ybg/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas91l8gp/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasf8dpzi/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasyviemr/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfase2ul3g/"></a>&#160;</td><td colspan="19" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasyk4dlg/"></a>1. Турғун шохобча (кўчма савдо объекти) мавжудлигини тасдиқлайдиган ҳужжатларнинг нусхалари</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="20" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas09gvab/"></a>(бино, иншоотнинг ёки унинг қисмининг ижара шартномаси ёки кадастр ҳужжатлари).</p></td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas67gvgv/"></a>&#160;</td><td colspan="19" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas8yckyb/"></a>2. Турғун савдо (хизмат кўрсатиш) шохобчаси (кўчма савдо объекти) манзилининг харитадаги</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="20" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfaspbmhfa/"></a>координатаси.</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="9" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfassymaym/"></a>__________________________</p></td><td style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas7lvxzd/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfaswmex9c/"></a>&#160;</td><td colspan="4" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasv7vkms/"></a>____________</p></td><td style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasqnlurf/"></a>&#160;</td><td colspan="3" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasso9lma/"></a>_________</p></td><td style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas16t7nz/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td colspan="9" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasa1gn3f/"></a>(Тадбиркорлик субъекти раҳбарининг Ф.И.О.)</p></td><td style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfascq3ily/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasgqgi6y/"></a>&#160;</td><td colspan="4" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasvt88dn/"></a>(имзо)</p></td><td style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasve9c3d/"></a>&#160;</td><td colspan="3" style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasomz4h0/"></a>(сана)&#187;</p></td><td style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasskh2r1/"></a>&#160;</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfasubazsb/"></a>к) Низомга 2-илова қуйидаги таҳрирда баён қилинсин:</p><div class="doc__untyped" data-type="untyped" data-level="6"><a data-role="toc" data-anchor="/document/90/10613/tit59/"></a><span level="" style="text-align:left" h_size="" class="doc__untyped-name"><a data-anchor="/document/90/10613/dfas5flbuu/"></a>&#171;Аҳоли билан пулли ҳисоб-китобларни амалга оширишда онлайн-НКМ ва (ёки) виртуал касса тизимини қўллаш тартиби тўғрисидаги низомга<br>2-ИЛОВА</span></div><div><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width=